From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 05:01:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] package the vendored Zstandard licence with the wheels

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not yet submitted; the same gap exists in every numcodecs wheel on PyPI, so it needs a maintainer discussion rather than a drive-by PR]

numcodecs compiles the Zstandard sources that c-blosc vendors under
c-blosc/internal-complibs/zstd-1.5.6 into both numcodecs.zstd and
numcodecs.blosc, but that directory carries no licence text: c-blosc
strips it when vendoring, and its own LICENSES directory covers only
bitshuffle, fastlz, lz4, snappy, stdint and zlib/zlib-ng.  The wheel's
license-files list globs exactly those, so every published numcodecs
wheel redistributes Zstandard in binary form without the copyright
notice its BSD-3-Clause licence requires to travel with it.

Add zstd 1.5.6's own LICENSE at the project root and list it, so it
lands in dist-info/licenses beside the others.
---
 LICENSE.zstd   | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 pyproject.toml |  1 +
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 LICENSE.zstd

diff --git a/LICENSE.zstd b/LICENSE.zstd
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7580028
--- /dev/null
+++ b/LICENSE.zstd
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+BSD License
+
+For Zstandard software
+
+Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. All rights reserved.
+
+Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification,
+are permitted provided that the following conditions are met:
+
+ * Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice, this
+   list of conditions and the following disclaimer.
+
+ * Redistributions in binary form must reproduce the above copyright notice,
+   this list of conditions and the following disclaimer in the documentation
+   and/or other materials provided with the distribution.
+
+ * Neither the name Facebook, nor Meta, nor the names of its contributors may
+   be used to endorse or promote products derived from this software without
+   specific prior written permission.
+
+THIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS "AS IS" AND
+ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED
+WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE
+DISCLAIMED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER OR CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR
+ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES
+(INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES;
+LOSS OF USE, DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON
+ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT
+(INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS
+SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.
diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index db2f3b6..a8c859e 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ maintainers = [
 license = "MIT"
 license-files = [
     "LICENSE.txt",
+    "LICENSE.zstd",
     "c-blosc/LICENSE.txt",
     "c-blosc/LICENSES/*",
 ]
